#   docs/specs/dance-runtime-rung-4-multi-peer-
#     coherence-phase-lock.md (Mara ratified)
#
# The substrate NAMED @dance verbatim in prose across these sites
# but never lifted it to family-root altitude. Alex's 2026-08-03
