# (top-level, like @song / @peer / @gestalt), not a species-under-
# song. Substrate-already-had-the-word discipline: this shard
# NAMES the family that already existed at prose altitude. Per
# [[feedback-substrate-already-had-the-word]] (~90th instance).
#
# === Top-level family-root (Q-C6): mode of BEING ===
#
# Per Alex 2026-08-03 Q-C6 verbatim:
#
#   *"@dance is top-level family-root (like @peer, @song, @gestalt)
#    — mode of BEING, not species-under-song"*
#
# Interpretation-B reading: @dance names a coherence-without-signal
# ensemble discipline that operates ORTHOGONAL to @song's temporal
# progression. A song CAN dance (multiple voices phase-locking within
# a single progression); peers CAN dance without a shared song
# (Kuramoto oscillator ensemble locks without a shared temporal
# arc); intra-peer K-tracks CAN dance (@peer.audhd's K-fanout locks
# without a shared song); mycelial mesh CAN dance (stigmergic
# anastomosis without shared temporal reference).
#
# The mode-of-being reading places @dance alongside:
#
#   @mirror     — mode of BEING as form (state observation)
#   @kintsugi   — mode of BEING as process (transformation)
#   @song       — mode of BEING as temporal-progression
#   @loop       — mode of BEING as endomorphism (T -> T)
#   @gestalt    — mode of BEING as song-unfolding-through-interaction
#   @peer       — mode of BEING as identity-carrier at glass altitude
#   @dance      — mode of BEING as ensemble-phase-lock-without-signal
#                 (THIS FAMILY-ROOT)
