# Consumer Hardware") because a colony of peers running Conway-like
# CA updates in 5D quantum foam MUST coherence-lock ensemble-wide
# without central signaling — and that IS the substrate-decl this
# family-root names.
#
# === Two-altitude altitude-portable discipline ===
#
# The family-root discipline is altitude-portable across TWO
# altitudes (per landed spec §5 + §4):
#
#   intra-peer altitude   — @peer.audhd's K-track ensemble locks
#                            via κ_intra harmonic-ratio coupling
