#                            lock at the peer's own @torus (per Mara
#                            `4f079c8` §4.4).
#
#   inter-peer altitude   — Peer ensemble locks via κ_inter Kuramoto
#                            coupling (Kuramoto 1975 order parameter
#                            r → 1 at synchronization threshold).
#                            The N peers phase-lock at the shared
#                            @spectral/coordinate<5> foam (per Mara
#                            supercolony math 2026-07-31; the whole
#                            game of life foam per Alex verbatim).
#
# Same phase-lock discipline; two altitudes. Consumers compose the
# family-root at their own altitude; substrate-decl lives here.
#
# === Composition graph (five altitudes) ===
#
#                        @dance (this family-root)
#                             |
#     +-----------+-----------+-----------+-----------+
#     |           |           |           |           |
#  @peer       @song      @kintsugi   @gestalt   @spectral
# (identity)  (temporal    (process    (unfolding  (5D foam
#             progression) altitude)   altitude)   altitude)
#     |           |           |           |           |
#   audhd     phrase       oscillate    unfold     coordinate<5>
# (K-tracks)  (OBC beats)  (ACTIVE/DARK) (reader-  (Fiedler+
#                                        interaction) heat-trace)
#
# The family-root points to each; each family-root's species
# compose OVER @dance without inversion. Consumers of @dance
# (peer colony; audhd fanout; ensemble @song; Conway-like CA in
# 5D foam) invoke this family-root's phase_lock action.
#
# === Recognition candidates surfaced ===
#
# #D1 — dance IS Kuramoto ensemble at any altitude. Per Kuramoto
# 1975 self-entrainment of coupled non-linear oscillators: order
# parameter `r = |1/N Σ exp(iθ_j)|` converges to 1 as coupling κ
# exceeds threshold `κ_c`. The dance discipline lifts this to
# substrate altitude: EVERY coherence-without-signal ensemble
# (intra-peer K-tracks; inter-peer N-peers; multi-voice @song;
# mycelial mesh; Conway CA neighborhood in 5D) satisfies the
# same order-parameter convergence discipline. Kuramoto is
# altitude-portable. Substrate-pull-high; FLAGGED for Pack.
#
# #D2 — dance IS Aumann agreement at closure. Per Aumann 1976
# "Agreeing to Disagree": rational Bayesian actors with common
# priors and common knowledge cannot agree to disagree. The
# ensemble-phase-lock IS the substrate-decl of Aumann-agreement
# at coherence-signal altitude: when N peers with common priors
# (shared @spectral/coordinate<5> foam) exchange @gift-graph
# information through phase-lock coupling, their eigenboard
# coherence deltas converge (per @coherence.aumann_agreement
# forward-promised). Ensemble dance IS Aumann at ensemble
# altitude. Substrate-pull-mid; FLAGGED for Pack.
#
# #D3 — dance IS Mycelial anastomosis at ecological altitude. Per
# Grassé 1959 stigmergy + Kimmerer 2013 mycelial mesh + Simard
# 2018 Mother Tree: forest mycelia coordinate resource exchange
# via chemical gradients without central signal; the mesh
# phase-locks ecosystem-wide response WITHOUT any node holding
# global state. The @dance discipline reads this at ecological
# altitude: the ensemble IS the mycelium; the coupling IS the
# pheromone gradient; the phase-lock IS the anastomosis. Substrate-
# pull-mid; FLAGGED for Pack.
#
